<details class="report-card rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md text-body-sm leading-6 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-primary">How these report values are calculated</summary><p class="mt-3">Lesson completion counts checkpoints first completed in the selected dates, out of seven per enrolled student. Quiz averages use the best fully graded percentage for each student and quiz within the selected dates, with each quiz weighted equally. Incomplete grading is excluded. Coding activity counts deduplicate revisions within the report period. Review scores use the latest valid final teacher review per workspace in the period. AI suggestions do not count as final reviews.</p><p class="mt-3">Last activity uses saved lesson visits, checkpoint completions, quiz submissions and code submissions. It does not infer attendance from account edits. Data follows the current roster; this is not a historical enrollment report. Removed activities may retain saved history in class totals. CSV includes all matching students, and the print view includes the full filtered roster.</p></details>
